```python
# Vue + Vuetify 2 Single File Component: Avataaars builder
# - buildAvatarUrl: single function to generate the avatar URL from selections
# - avatarUrl: computed main avatar image that updates dynamically
# - previewsByCategory: computed option images to preview changes per option
# - localStorage persistence: saves/restores selections and preselects on app restart
#
