Below is a complete, runnable Flask app that renders a compact /embed UI for pasting recipe text or uploading .txt/.pdf files, extracts ingredients, performs public lookups (Wikipedia/Wikidata/Datamuse) with timeouts and error handling, generates a whimsical “spell,” and displays clear success/error pages.

How to embed on Square:
- Deploy this app to a public URL (for example, https://your-spell-app.example.com)
- In Square Online > Website > Edit site > Add section > Embed code, paste this exact snippet (replace the domain with yours):
  <iframe src="https://your-spell-app.example.com/embed" width="100%" height="960" style="border:0;max-width:100%"></iframe>

